WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.390
- Lynn, have you told everybody
about your Les Mis speaker

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:03.650
in your dressing room?

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.980
- No, yeah.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:05.980
- What?

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.810
- I guess the statute of
limitations have past.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.250
I broke the law,

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.690
from 2015 to 2016.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.809
We were neighbors with a
production of Les Miserables.

00:00:14.809 --> 00:00:15.642
(woman laughs)

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:17.150
I guess we can tell this story now.

